### 1. GET all rooms (Expect: 200, 3 rooms)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 2. GET rooms with minCapacity=6 (Expect: 200, 2 rooms)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minCapacity=6

### 3. GET rooms with keyword=Seminar (Expect: 200, 1 room)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?keyword=Seminar

### 4. GET rooms with minCapacity=6 and keyword=Seminar (Expect: 200, 1 room)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minCapacity=6&keyword=Seminar

### 5. GET room 1 (Expect: 200, Seminar A)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### 6. GET room 99 (Expect: 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99

### 7. POST create room Library (Expect: 201 Created + Location header)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Library",
  "capacity": 10
}

### 8. PUT room 4 change capacity to 15 (Expect: 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Library",
  "capacity": 15
}

### 9. PUT room 99 (Expect: 404 Not Found)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost",
  "capacity": 5
}

### 10. DELETE room 4 (Expect: 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/4

### 11. DELETE room 4 again (Expect: 404 Not Found)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/4

### 12. POST create room capacity 0 (Expect: 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Closet",
  "capacity": 0
}

### 13. PUT room 1 capacity 25 (Expect: 400 Bad Request)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Seminar A",
  "capacity": 25
}

### 14. GET stats room count (Expect: 200, {"rooms": 3})
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 15. GET reservations for room 1 (Expect: 200, 3 reservations)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations?roomId=1

### 16. GET reservations for room 99 (Expect: 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations?roomId=99

### 17. GET reservations by Mina (Expect: 200, 2 reservations)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations?reservedBy=Mina

### 18. POST reservation for room 1 (Expect: 201 Created + Location)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "Ken",
  "startTime": "2026-10-06T11:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-06T12:00:00"
}

### 19. POST reservation touching edge 11:00 (Expect: 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "Sarah",
  "startTime": "2026-10-06T12:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-06T13:00:00"
}

### 20. POST reservation overlapping Mina 10:30-11:30 (Expect: 409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "Overlap",
  "startTime": "2026-10-06T10:30:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-06T11:30:00"
}

### 21. POST reservation room 99 (Expect: 404 Not Found)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 99,
  "reservedBy": "Ghost",
  "startTime": "2026-10-06T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-06T11:00:00"
}

### 22. POST reservation end before start (Expect: 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "TimeTraveler",
  "startTime": "2026-10-06T11:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-06T10:00:00"
}

### 23. POST reservation start equals end (Expect: 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "ZeroTime",
  "startTime": "2026-10-06T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-06T10:00:00"
}

### 24. GET single reservation 1 (Expect: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/1

### 25. DELETE reservation 1 (Expect: 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/1

### 26. PUT room 2 same values (Expect: 200, dirty check: select only, no update)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study Pod",
  "capacity": 4
}

### 27. PUT room 2 new values (Expect: 200, dirty check: select + update)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study Pod XL",
  "capacity": 6
}

### 28. POST room blank name (Expect: 400, fieldErrors: name)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "capacity": 8
}

### 29. POST room capacity 0 (Expect: 400, fieldErrors: capacity)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Closet",
  "capacity": 0
}

### 30. POST room blank name and capacity 50 (Expect: 400, two fieldErrors)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "capacity": 50
}

### 31. GET room 99 (Expect: 404, ApiError: room 99 not found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99

### 32. DELETE room 1 with active reservations (Expect: 409 Conflict)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### 33. GET unknown URL (Expect: 404, not 500)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nothing

### 34. POST reservation blank reservedBy (Expect: 400, fieldErrors: reservedBy)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "",
  "startTime": "2026-10-08T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-08T11:00:00"
}

### 35. POST reservation no endTime (Expect: 400, fieldErrors: endTime)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "Tester",
  "startTime": "2026-10-08T10:00:00"
}

### 36. POST reservation end before start (Expect: 400, startTime must be before endTime)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "Tester",
  "startTime": "2026-10-08T12:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-08T11:00:00"
}

### 37. POST reservation overlapping existing (Expect: 409, already booked)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "Clash",
  "startTime": "2026-10-06T10:15:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-06T10:45:00"
}

### 38. GET reservation 99 (Expect: 404, reservation 99 not found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/99

### 39. GET reservations without required parameter (Expect: 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations

### 40. POST room with invalid JSON type (Expect: 400, not valid JSON)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad Types Room",
  "capacity": "ten"
}

### 41. GET room with wrong path variable type (Expect: 400, 'id' has the wrong type)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/abc

### 42. POST room with missing name field (Expect: 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacity": 10
}

### 43. PUT non-existent room 999 (Expect: 404 Not Found)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Room",
  "capacity": 10
}